Package: MRSuSiE
Type: Package
Title: Joint Selection of Causal Exposures and Invalid Instruments
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Siyi", "Chen", email = "sche11@lsuhsc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the MVMR-SuSiE summary-data method for joint
    prioritization of causal exposures and variants with direct outcome
    effects. The package supports continuous-outcome sufficient statistics,
    binary-outcome score statistics, linkage disequilibrium, and an
    LD-adjusted corrected-score estimator after direct-variant selection.
